    <ul>
      <li>We moved to Australia as a family of four in summer 2026. I flew ahead on <strong>23 June</strong>, Lucy and the kids landed in Brisbane on <strong>28 July 2026</strong>.</li>
      <li>Restaurant die farm in Essen, lease from <strong>1 February 2019</strong> to <strong>31 December 2025</strong>. The decision to emigrate was made in <strong>early September 2025</strong>, when our second field had to be cleared.</li>
      <li>Visa route: eVisitor 651 (free) → sponsor found on the ground → <strong>186 Employer Nomination Scheme</strong>. My employer's nomination is currently in progress.</li>
      <li>Where we are now: we live in the hinterland near Murwillumbah, the search for a permanent home is on, and Joris' first Australian school day is <strong>3 February 2027</strong>.</li>
